# Changes
- Changed Chorus Pie recipe to actually use a Chorus Fruit
- Added new Waypoint Types: Cinnabar, Diamond, Emerald, Golden, Iron, Lodestone, Netherite, Poplar, Red Nether Bricks, Redstone & Resin
- Added a Back Teleport to the actions menu (costs 5 exp level)
- Waypoint, Home, Random, Back and Spawn teleport actions now have a 3 seconds cooldown
- Setting a home now asks for confirmation when a home is already set
- Coordinates HUD now also shows the light level at a players position
- Event leaderboard with the top 3 players shown to event participants when an event ends

# Fixes
- Letterbox Posteffect for village names getting stuck
- Treasure trade for master Villagers having an empty book instead
- Wandering Trader having an empty enchanted book instead of an actual one